cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "The files in this repository are an unofficial Chinese-language port of the software below, adapted to the WorkBuddy platform and maintained for personal study. The author, the design and the academic content are the original author's; cite the original work. —— 本仓库是下列原始作品的中文移植版（WorkBuddy 平台，个人学习用途），作者与学术内容均归原作者，引用请引用原始作品。"
title: "Claude Code Academic Workflow: a verification-gated research template for economists"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sant'Anna"
    given-names: "Pedro H. C."
    website: "https://psantanna.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pedrohcgs/claude-code-my-workflow"
url: "https://psantanna.com/claude-code-my-workflow/"
license: MIT
version: 2.6.0
date-released: 2026-09-26
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - economics
  - econometrics
  - reproducible-research
  - causal-inference
  - academic-writing
  - research-workflow
abstract: >-
  Unofficial Chinese-language port (personal study, WorkBuddy platform) of the
  work described below. A ready-to-fork Claude Code template for academic
  research — slides, papers,
  data analysis, and Monte Carlo simulation studies. Verification-gated by
  design: fan-out review fleets with hallucination gates, numeric-claim
  reproducibility audits against code, an enforcing pre-commit quality gate,
  and a qualification ledger that records what every check has been proven
  to detect.
